From fb50705d737e823bcb61fb912e6203ee91f5d3e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phase14 audit <audit@local>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:37:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/20] fix(seo): no canonical on the 404 template, lang=en-US
 everywhere, repair the dead ROI-calculator link
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 14 batch B7 (audit 2026-09-01, T15 / T16 / T17).
- 404 template: canonicalUrl is empty and SeoHead omits <link rel=canonical>
  / og:url when it is — the page was self-canonicalising to /404/, a URL
  that does not exist
- <html lang>: native hubs said 'en' while the other 581 pages said
  'en-US'; extractChromeFromSnapshot now runs the donor <html> attributes
  through sanitizeHtmlAttrs (also dropping the WP itemtype leftovers) and
  the 9 native pages declare en-US. Build: 598/598 pages en-US.
- /blog/rfid-rfp-template-questions-suppliers/: the resource card linked
  /downloads/rfid-roi-calculator.xlsx, which is not in the build; it now
  points at the on-site cost estimator tool.
The 9 'missing alt' images from Phase 2 are decorative industry icons with
alt="" + aria-hidden — correct as they are; no change.
